I mean both. Yeah.

00:32:41.860 --> 00:32:42.860
Okay. Like I just feel like

00:32:42.860 --> 00:32:44.660
the spread on my projectiles

00:32:44.660 --> 00:32:45.680
was taking care

00:32:45.680 --> 00:32:46.660
